# Secrets

- Store keys only in `.env` (gitignored). Start from `.env.example`.
- Never print full API keys, never commit `.env`, cookies, or `session.pkl`.
- This project needs exactly one key: `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`, used only for captcha OCR.
  It is sent as `Authorization: Bearer`, alongside the `HTTP-Referer` and `X-Title`
  attribution headers.
- Each stage of the pipeline keeps its own `.env`. Stage 2's model keys live in
  `../02-enrich/.env`, stage 3's mail credentials in `../03-outreach/.env`. Do not
  read another stage's secrets from here.
